{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dearest Marie,\n\nThe Rhine here is grand, heavy with large two-masted vessels that seem to carry the weight of the world. I have spent the day wandering the churches, finding the stone quiet compared to the noise of the streets.\n\nI look forward to the cathedral tomorrow morning. The Counts Stolberg and Dean Kellermann are joining me for the mass; the music is said to be exquisite, a necessary counterpoint to the practicality of our daily lives. It is good to be among those who still value the sacred in art.\n\nI must ride for Aachen this afternoon. The journey is not long, but the roads are dusty. Do not worry for me; I am well and my spirits are high. Keep the house in order and tell the boys I expect them to be diligent in their studies, for freedom is earned through discipline, not given as a gift.\n\nGive my love to the children.\n\nYour faithful,\nG.W.F. Hegel"}}],"created":1795080089,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":202,"prompt_tokens":938,"total_tokens":1140,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-q9xbRPbI41Hym4ZHedyko8M03mTQHVZ0","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":938,"prompt_ms":917.906,"prompt_per_token_ms":0.9785778251599146,"prompt_per_second":1021.8911304643394,"predicted_n":202,"predicted_ms":4770.009,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.731388059701494,"predicted_per_second":42.138285273675585}}